  "shared_implementation": "Resource reviews retain the same shared LanguageAnalysis as text reviews. Both filesystem modes use one editor policy flow and the original native-language facade. Approval captures the displayed review. No native pending-command exception or missing-proof bypass was added.",
  "contract": [
    "Ordered workspace edits require an exact retained normalized edit before resource inspection. Command-bearing actions require the entire original ActionReview; changed command arguments and edit-only downgrades reject before inspection.",
    "Command approval data comes from the captured original request and selected provider. The mutable result_language slot was removed.",
    "Original-service validation runs after recovery preflight and before publishing a Pending status or creating durable transaction intent. Source/review/root and complete editor recovery guards are checked again after validation. Intrinsic file read-only uses the recovery context, independently of the operation own temporary editor lock.",
    "Obsolete review approvals cannot select replacements. Native rejection creates no transaction, mutates no file and retains the review for retry."
  ],
